# Trading in a Global Economy: Obstacles and Opportunities.

**Authors:** Gell, Robert L., Crupi, James A.

## Abstract
Highlights ways community colleges can assist local businesses with trading in an global economy, pointing to areas where lack of information can have negative results. Colleges can provide knowledge about international relations and international law, facilitate networking among interested business executives, and provide practical training for export operations. (DMM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ439923

